specs/hal-engine-websocket-protocol/spec.md:320:- A message the server cannot parse into a known type is answered with `INVALID_MESSAGE`, and no message stream is started for it ([validated by: rejects an unparseable message and never starts a stream](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L72)).
specs/hal-engine-websocket-protocol/spec.md:321:- A rate limit reported by the AI provider is surfaced as `RATE_LIMITED`, which tells the client the same request is worth retrying ([validated by: tells the client to retry when the provider is rate limited](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L351)).
